{% comment %}
  ENAMELS ONLINE — SINGLE-PAGE CUSTOMIZATION & SELF-SERVICE TAILORING STUDIO
  Preserves authentic single-page customization architecture with NO step-by-step wizard.
  Features:
  - Unified single page: All product details, options, swatches, sizing, alterations,
    engraving, logo, and order summary visible together on one page.
  - Article / Series Quick-Switcher (Sprinter, Velora, Crown, FlexFit, Lab Coat)
  - Interactive Colour Swatches directly beneath product image
  - "Make Your Own Color" strictly HIDDEN for Sprinter series! (Enabled for Crown/Velora)
  - Standard Sizes (XS-2XL) + Custom Tailored Measurements Studio (Inches & CM)
  - Garment Alterations (Top, Trouser, Sleeve lengths, tailoring notes)
  - Name Engraving: Direct Engraving & Stitched Patch with live Times New Roman simulation
  - Thread color selection & live high-contrast pocket preview
  - Hospital Logo Crest Gallery (AKUH, SKMCH, PIMS, DUHS, KEMU, Custom) + Left/Right placement
  - Complementary clinical add-ons (BunFit Cap, Med Arm Sleeves)
  - Transparent itemized order summary, advance payment disclaimers, and cart integration
  - Integrated In-Person Representative Visit Request Section (Lahore Only) on the SAME page
  - Persistent request storage & Admin Management Portal
{% endcomment %}

<div class="chroma-view-panel" id="view-product-studio">
  <div class="page-container">

    <!-- VALID PRODUCT STUDIO CONTENT WRAPPER -->
    <div id="pdp-valid-studio-view">

      <!-- Breadcrumb Navigation -->
      <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; padding: 20px 0 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="#" onclick="window.navigateToView('home'); return false;" style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <a href="#gender" onclick="window.navigateToGenderCrumb(); return false;" id="pdp-breadcrumb-gender" style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none;">Men</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <a href="#category" onclick="window.returnToArticleListing(); return false;" id="pdp-breadcrumb-cat" style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none;">Scrubs</a>
          <span id="pdp-breadcrumb-series-sep" style="display: none;">/</span>
          <a href="#series" onclick="window.returnToArticleListing(); return false;" id="pdp-breadcrumb-series" style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none; display: none;">Series</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <strong style="color: #102a43;" id="pdp-breadcrumb-title">Sprinter Men's Athletic Scrub Set</strong>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="#category-scrubs" onclick="window.returnToArticleListing(); return false;" class="pdp-back-btn-pill" style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #102a43; background: #f1f5f9; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;">
            ← Back to Articles
          </a>
          <!-- Quick Anchor to Representative Visit -->
          <a href="#representative-visit-section" onclick="window.scrollToRepVisitSection(); return false;" style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #008779; background: #e6fffa; border: 1px solid #99f6e4; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;">
            📍 Prefer Sizing at Your Clinic? Request Lahore Visit ↓
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Informative 7-Step Overview Anchor Bar (Clicking scrolls directly to that box on the same page) -->
      <div class="pdp-stepper-track" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <a href="#pdp-color-selection-step-box" onclick="window.scrollToPdpBox('pdp-color-selection-step-box'); return false;" class="pdp-step-indicator active" id="stepper-step-1" style="text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;">
          <span class="pdp-step-circle">1</span>
          <span>Colours</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#pdp-size-box" onclick="window.scrollToPdpBox('pdp-size-box'); return false;" class="pdp-step-indicator" id="stepper-step-2" style="text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;">
          <span class="pdp-step-circle">2</span>
          <span>Size & Fit</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#pdp-alterations-step-box" onclick="window.scrollToPdpBox('pdp-alterations-step-box'); return false;" class="pdp-step-indicator" id="stepper-step-3" style="text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;">
          <span class="pdp-step-circle">3</span>
          <span>Alterations</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#pdp-engraving-step-box" onclick="window.scrollToPdpBox('pdp-engraving-step-box'); return false;" class="pdp-step-indicator" id="stepper-step-4" style="text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;">
          <span class="pdp-step-circle">4</span>
          <span>Engraving</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#pdp-logo-step-box" onclick="window.scrollToPdpBox('pdp-logo-step-box'); return false;" class="pdp-step-indicator" id="stepper-step-5" style="text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;">
          <span class="pdp-step-circle">5</span>
          <span>Logo</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#pdp-summary-step-box" onclick="window.scrollToPdpBox('pdp-summary-step-box'); return false;" class="pdp-step-indicator" id="stepper-step-6" style="text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;">
          <span class="pdp-step-circle">6</span>
          <span>Summary</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#representative-visit-section" onclick="window.scrollToRepVisitSection(); return false;" class="pdp-step-indicator" id="stepper-step-7" style="text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; color: #008779;">
          <span class="pdp-step-circle" style="background: #e6fffa; color: #008779; border-color: #99f6e4;">7</span>
          <span>Lahore Visit</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    <!-- Studio Two-Column Layout (Left Visual + Right Customization Column) -->
    <div class="pdp-studio-layout">

      <!-- LEFT COLUMN: Product Visual Media & Live Chest Pocket Simulation -->
      <div class="pdp-visual-column">
        <div class="pdp-main-image-frame" id="pdp-image-stage">
          <img
            src="{{ 'demo-sprinter-navy.jpg' | asset_url }}"
            alt="Enamels Uniform Mockup"
            id="pdp-active-photo"
            class="pdp-main-photo"
            width="700"
            height="850"
            loading="eager"
          />

          <!-- Live Left Chest Pocket Embroidery Overlay with Times New Roman Simulation -->
          <div class="pdp-pocket-sim-overlay" id="pocket-sim-overlay" style="display: none;">
            <div id="sim-logo-preview-wrap" style="display: none; margin-bottom: 4px;">
              <!-- Dynamic Logo Emblem Preview -->
            </div>
            <div class="embroidery-preview-text line-1" id="pocket-doctor-name">DR. AYESHA MALIK</div>
            <div class="embroidery-preview-text line-2" id="pocket-doctor-dept">CARDIOLOGY</div>
            <div class="embroidery-preview-text line-3" id="pocket-doctor-sub">AGA KHAN HOSPITAL</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Placement Disclaimer Pill -->
          <div class="embroidery-sim-disclaimer" id="embroidery-disclaimer-pill" style="display: none;">
            🪡 Live Embroidery Simulation (Times New Roman)
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Color Swatches Directly Beneath Product Image -->
        <div class="pdp-step-box" id="pdp-swatches-box" style="margin-top: 16px; padding: 16px; background: #f8fafc;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #102a43; text-transform: uppercase;">Available Fabric Shades:</span>
            <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #102a43;" id="pdp-selected-color-title">Deep Navy</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pdp-swatches-grid" id="pdp-bottom-swatches-grid">
            <!-- Dynamically populated from active product variant data -->
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- In-Person Representative Visit Concierge Card (Left Column Callout) -->
        <div style="margin-top: 16px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 6px;">
            <span style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;">LAHORE SERVICE</span>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #102a43;">Prefer In-Person Sizing?</span>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.4;">
            An Enamels representative visits your hospital or clinic with genuine fabric swatches & physical sizing samples.
          </p>
          <a href="#representative-visit-section" onclick="window.scrollToRepVisitSection(); return false;" class="btn-step-prev" style="width: 100%; text-align: center; justify-content: center; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #008779; background: #f0fdfa; border-color: #99f6e4;">
            📅 Request Lahore Visit on this Page ↓
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT COLUMN: Single-Page Customization Configurator (ALL BOXES VISIBLE TOGETHER) -->
      <div class="pdp-config-column">

        <!-- Product Series, Title, Price, Description -->
        <div class="pdp-header-card" style="margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 16px;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
              <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background: #102a43; color: #ffffff; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.04em;" id="pdp-series-badge">SPRINTER SERIES</span>
              <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px;" id="pdp-gender-badge">MEN'S COLLECTION</span>
              <span style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;" id="pdp-sku-display">SKU: ENM-SPRN-NVY</span>
            </div>
            <a href="#category-scrubs" onclick="window.returnToArticleListing(); return false;" class="pdp-back-listing-link">
              ← Back to Article Listing
            </a>
          </div>
          <h1 style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: #102a43; margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.25;" id="pdp-title-display">
            Sprinter Men's Athletic Scrub Set
          </h1>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            <span style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #102a43;" id="pdp-base-price-display">Rs. 5,150</span>
            <span style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: line-through;" id="pdp-compare-price-display">Rs. 5,800</span>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #008779; background: #e6fffa; border: 1px solid #99f6e4; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px;">In Stock • Nationwide Delivery</span>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #475569; margin: 0; line-height: 1.55;" id="pdp-desc-display">
            Engineered for high-tempo emergency shifts and clinical rounds. Tailored raglan sleeves for unrestricted arm mobility, deep chest pocket with pen slot, and 6-pocket functional cargo joggers with ribbed cuffs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 1: AVAILABLE COLOURS & FABRIC SHADES (DIRECT SELECTION - NO DUPLICATE ARTICLE PROMPT) -->
        <div class="pdp-step-box" id="pdp-color-selection-step-box">
          <div class="pdp-step-box-header">
            <h3 class="pdp-step-title">
              <span>Step 1: Select Available Colour</span>
            </h3>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;" id="pdp-active-fabric-tag">4-Way Mechanical Stretch</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Selected Colour Status Strip -->
          <div class="pdp-active-color-status-bar">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
              <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">Selected Shade:</span>
              <span class="pdp-selected-color-pill-dot" id="pdp-color-indicator-dot" style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.2); background: #102a43; display: inline-block;"></span>
              <strong style="font-size: 13px; color: #102a43;" id="pdp-config-selected-color-name">Deep Navy</strong>
            </div>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; color: #008779; font-weight: 700; background: #e6fffa; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px;" id="pdp-color-count-tag">
              Available Colours
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Swatches Grid for this Product -->
          <div class="pdp-color-picker-grid" id="pdp-config-color-cards-grid">
            <!-- Dynamically populated with colors offered for this product -->
          </div>

          <p style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; margin: 12px 0 0; line-height: 1.4;">
            💡 <em>Colours shown are certified for this article. Selecting a colour updates the preview photo and live chest pocket embroidery simulation.</em>
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 2: SIZE SELECTION (STANDARD SIZES + CUSTOM MEASUREMENTS STUDIO) -->
        <div class="pdp-step-box" id="pdp-size-box">
          <div class="pdp-step-box-header">
            <h3 class="pdp-step-title">
              <span>Step 2: Select Size & Fit</span>
            </h3>
            <button type="button" onclick="window.openSizeGuideModal()" style="background: none; border: none; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #00b8a9; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline;">
              📏 Size Guide (Inches & CM)
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Standard Sizes Grid -->
          <div class="pdp-sizes-grid" id="pdp-sizes-grid">
            <button type="button" class="pdp-size-chip" data-size="XS" onclick="window.selectStandardSize('XS')">XS</button>
            <button type="button" class="pdp-size-chip" data-size="S" onclick="window.selectStandardSize('S')">S</button>
            <button type="button" class="pdp-size-chip active" data-size="M" onclick="window.selectStandardSize('M')">M</button>
            <button type="button" class="pdp-size-chip" data-size="L" onclick="window.selectStandardSize('L')">L</button>
            <button type="button" class="pdp-size-chip" data-size="XL" onclick="window.selectStandardSize('XL')">XL</button>
            <button type="button" class="pdp-size-chip" data-size="2XL" onclick="window.selectStandardSize('2XL')">2XL</button>
            <button type="button" class="pdp-size-chip rtw-size-chip-c" id="pdp-chip-custom" data-size="C" onclick="window.selectPdpCustomExplicit()">C (Custom)</button>
          </div>

          <!-- Dynamic Sizing State Banner -->
          <div id="pdp-size-status-indicator" style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #f0fdfa; color: #008779; border: 1px solid #99f6e4; transition: all 0.2s ease;">
            <span id="pdp-size-status-icon">📐</span>
            <span id="pdp-size-status-text">Standard Preset Active: Medium (M) — Sizing chart auto-populated</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Custom Tailored Sizing Option Toggle -->
          <div style="margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed #e2e8f0;">
            <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #102a43; cursor: pointer;">
              <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-custom-measurements-check" onchange="window.toggleCustomMeasurementsForm(this.checked)" />
              <span>Inspect or Edit Exact Body Measurements (Auto-Converts to Custom C)</span>
            </label>
          </div>

          <!-- Custom Measurements Drawer / Subpanel -->
          <div id="pdp-custom-measurements-panel" style="display: none; margin-top: 12px; background: #f8fafc; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;">
              <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #102a43; text-transform: uppercase;">Finished Garment Dimensions</span>
              <div style="display: flex; gap: 4px;">
                <button type="button" class="gender-pill-btn active" id="meas-unit-in" onclick="window.setMeasurementUnit('in')" style="padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 10px;">Inches</button>
                <button type="button" class="gender-pill-btn" id="meas-unit-cm" onclick="window.setMeasurementUnit('cm')" style="padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 10px;">CM</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="alteration-fields-grid">
              <div class="form-field-group">
                <label>Chest / Bust (<span class="unit-label">in</span>) <span class="rtw-field-tag" id="tag-pdp-chest"></span></label>
                <input type="number" step="0.5" class="form-field-input" id="meas-input-chest" placeholder="e.g. 40" oninput="window.handlePdpMeasurementChange(this)" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-field-group">
                <label>Waist (<span class="unit-label">in</span>) <span class="rtw-field-tag" id="tag-pdp-waist"></span></label>
                <input type="number" step="0.5" class="form-field-input" id="meas-input-waist" placeholder="e.g. 33" oninput="window.handlePdpMeasurementChange(this)" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-field-group">
                <label>Hips (<span class="unit-label">in</span>) <span class="rtw-field-tag" id="tag-pdp-hips"></span></label>
                <input type="number" step="0.5" class="form-field-input" id="meas-input-hips" placeholder="e.g. 41" oninput="window.handlePdpMeasurementChange(this)" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-field-group">
                <label>Top / Shirt Length (<span class="unit-label">in</span>) <span class="rtw-field-tag" id="tag-pdp-top"></span></label>
                <input type="number" step="0.5" class="form-field-input" id="meas-input-top" placeholder="e.g. 28" oninput="window.handlePdpMeasurementChange(this)" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-field-group">
                <label>Inseam / Trouser Length (<span class="unit-label">in</span>) <span class="rtw-field-tag" id="tag-pdp-inseam"></span></label>
                <input type="number" step="0.5" class="form-field-input" id="meas-input-inseam" placeholder="e.g. 40" oninput="window.handlePdpMeasurementChange(this)" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn-card-action" onclick="window.saveCustomMeasurements()" style="margin-top: 12px; padding: 10px;">
              ✓ Confirm Measurements & Fit
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 3: ALTERATION OPTIONS -->
        <div class="pdp-step-box" id="pdp-alterations-step-box">
          <div class="pdp-step-box-header">
            <h3 class="pdp-step-title">
              <span>Step 3: Optional Alterations</span>
            </h3>
            <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #102a43;">+Rs. 350</span>
          </div>

          <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #102a43; cursor: pointer;">
            <input type="checkbox" id="pdp-enable-alterations" onchange="window.toggleAlterations(this.checked)" />
            <span>Enable Tailoring Alterations (+Rs. 350)</span>
          </label>

          <div id="pdp-alterations-box" style="display: none; margin-top: 14px;">
            <div class="alteration-fields-grid">
              <div class="form-field-group">
                <label>Shirt / Top Length</label>
                <select class="form-field-select" id="alt-shirt-length" onchange="window.updateAlterationDetails()">
                  <option value="Standard">Standard Factory Length</option>
                  <option value="+1 Inch">+1 Inch Longer (+2.5 cm)</option>
                  <option value="+2 Inches">+2 Inches Longer (+5.0 cm)</option>
                  <option value="-1 Inch">-1 Inch Shorter (-2.5 cm)</option>
                  <option value="-2 Inches">-2 Inches Shorter (-5.0 cm)</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="form-field-group">
                <label>Trouser Length</label>
                <select class="form-field-select" id="alt-trouser-length" onchange="window.updateAlterationDetails()">
                  <option value="Standard">Standard Factory Length</option>
                  <option value="+1.5 Inches">+1.5 Inches Longer (+3.8 cm)</option>
                  <option value="+2 Inches">+2 Inches Longer (+5.0 cm)</option>
                  <option value="-1.5 Inches">-1.5 Inches Shorter (-3.8 cm)</option>
                  <option value="-2 Inches">-2 Inches Shorter (-5.0 cm)</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="form-field-group">
                <label>Sleeve Length</label>
                <select class="form-field-select" id="alt-sleeve-length" onchange="window.updateAlterationDetails()">
                  <option value="Half Sleeve (Standard)">Half Sleeve (Clinical Standard)</option>
                  <option value="Full Sleeve (+Rs. 250)">Full Sleeve with Ribbed Cuffs (+Rs. 250)</option>
                  <option value="3/4 Modest Sleeve">3/4 Modest Sleeve</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="form-field-group">
                <label>Tailoring Notes & Instructions</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-field-input" id="alt-notes" placeholder="e.g. Please taper waist by 1 inch" oninput="window.updateAlterationDetails()" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Advance Payment Disclaimer for Alterations -->
            <div class="advance-payment-alert-box">
              <span class="advance-alert-icon">⚠️</span>
              <div>
                <div class="advance-alert-title">Advance Payment Required for Alterations</div>
                <p class="advance-alert-text">
                  Garment alterations are custom-tailored to your measurements. 100% advance payment via Bank Transfer is required prior to tailoring.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 4: ENGRAVING / EMBROIDERY CUSTOMIZATION (WITH LIVE TIMES NEW ROMAN PREVIEW) -->
        <div class="pdp-step-box" id="pdp-engraving-step-box">
          <div class="pdp-step-box-header">
            <h3 class="pdp-step-title">
              <span>Step 4: Optional Name Engraving / Embroidery</span>
            </h3>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
            <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer;">
              <input type="radio" name="pdp_engraving_type" value="none" checked onchange="window.setEngravingType('none')" />
              <span>No Personalization (Plain Uniform)</span>
            </label>
            <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer;">
              <input type="radio" name="pdp_engraving_type" value="direct" onchange="window.setEngravingType('direct')" />
              <span><strong>Direct Engraving</strong> on Left Chest (+Rs. 450)</span>
            </label>
            <label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer;">
              <input type="radio" name="pdp_engraving_type" value="patch" onchange="window.setEngravingType('patch')" />
              <span><strong>Stitched Patch</strong> Engraving (+Rs. 550)</span>
            </label>
          </div>

          <div id="pdp-engraving-inputs-box" style="display: none; margin-top: 14px;">
            <div class="form-field-group" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
              <label>Line 1: Clinician Full Name</label>
              <input type="text" class="form-field-input" id="engraving-line-1" placeholder="e.g. Dr. Ayesha Malik" oninput="window.updateLiveEngravingPreview()" maxlength="30" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field-group" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
              <label>Line 2: Specialty / Designation</label>
              <input type="text" class="form-field-input" id="engraving-line-2" placeholder="e.g. Consultant Cardiologist" oninput="window.updateLiveEngravingPreview()" maxlength="35" />
            </div>
