            <div><strong>Location:</strong> <span id="rep-success-address">Services Hospital, Jail Road, Lahore</span></div>
            <div><strong>Preferred Slot:</strong> <span id="rep-success-timing">Tomorrow, Afternoon</span></div>
            <div><strong>Products:</strong> <span id="rep-success-products">2x Sprinter Scrub Sets</span></div>
            <div><strong>Consultation Fee:</strong> Rs. 500 <span style="color: #00b8a9; font-weight: 600;">(100% Adjustable Against Orders &gt;= Rs. 10,000)</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a
